  "finding": "Both baseline and candidate start with50 zero standard-source packets per deck while all50 auxiliary locations already show native1944. Thereafter both expose nativeUSB1 tuple(1,3,1,1944) andUSB2(1,2,1,1944) continuously in their captured windows. The zero-prefix/auxiliary-native pattern therefore occurs without candidate effects; it is not sufficient evidence of mod-induced suppression.",
